      "response_text": "Based on the given passages, a ruptured eardrum can be caused by several factors such as middle ear infection (otitis media), foreign objects in the ear, severe head trauma, explosion, loud noise, or surgery.",
      "role": "training",
      "sealed_prompt_sha256": "sha256:527ff55052b3e17bbfee096ef27868104917949d33eb8347495d22d40fa3d678",
